From ead389cef072c42cb2edee9d558052c10fd0c766 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gokul Sriram Palanisamy <gokul.sriram.p@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Jul 2025 09:13:49 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] qdl: add support for mhi firehose device

enable flashing of SDX over mhi firehose channel. when using MHI, SAHARA
transfer is handled by MHI sysfs. So skipping sahara_run().

while SDX enters EDL, firehose device programmer can be loaded over BHI
which can execute on device and opens MHI firehose channel which can be
used to communicae with the programmer to transfer the binaries and
flash SDX meta.

Signed-off-by: Gokul Sriram Palanisamy <gokul.sriram.p@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 Makefile  |  4 +--
 io.c      |  3 ++
 mhi.c     | 86 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 program.c |  2 +-
 qdl.c     | 33 +++++++++++++++++----
 qdl.h     |  8 +++++-
 6 files changed, 127 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 mhi.c

